issue.body:
**Describe the bug**
Storybook Docs container context has changed since `6.4.0-alpha.33`
I used to rely on its context to deal with the property `kind` or gets updated `globals`.
Now, these properties have disappeared and `kind` seems to be replaced by `title` instead.
But nothing about that into the changelog.

```javascript
export const parameters = {
  docs: {
    container: props => {
      console.log(props.context);
      return (<DocsContainer {...props} />);
    },
  },
};
```
